version 0.1  Initial version
- App can login to APIC and list VRFs, L3Outs and BGP peers
- VRFs can display routing tables
- L3Out can display its details Nodes and Interfaces, Peers, route-maps
- BGP peers list all peers and details can be viewed.
- BGP peers can get `bgp neighbor` info, `bgp routes` and `bgp advertised-routes` through SSH
- Exporting and comparing is available for routing tables and bgp tables

version 0.2 (current)
- Filtering and sorting for routing table and bgp tables views
- allowing the app to work without `config.yaml` and add possibility to enter APIC IP manually

